  "notes": "{問|と}う is a formal transitive verb meaning to question, inquire, or hold accountable. More literary than ⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{問|と}う\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{理由|りゆう}→理由：01102_riyuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{問|と}う: to ask the reason\n- ⟦{責任|せきにん}→責任：03298_sekinin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{問|と}う: to hold someone responsible\n- ⟦{是非|ぜひ}→是非：19460_zehi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{問|と}う: to question right and wrong\n- ～⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{問|と}わず: regardless of ~\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{問|と}い{合|あ}わせる→問い合わせる：17737_toiawaseru⟧: to inquire (at a service desk)\n- ⟦{問|と}い{合|あ}わせ→問い合わせ：06131_toiawase⟧: inquiry\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal and often used in written or official contexts. For casual questions, use ⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧ or ⟦{尋|たず}ねる→尋ねる：01175_tazuneru⟧.",
